# Shivera Client Acquisition Agent - Email Configuration
# To send cold outreach emails directly from the agent using business.shivera@gmail.com:
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security (https://myaccount.google.com/security)
# 2. Make sure 2-Step Verification is ON
# 3. Search for "App Passwords" (https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords)
# 4. Create a new App Password named "Shivera Outreach Agent"
# 5. Copy the 16-character code into GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD below and save as .env

GMAIL_USER=business.shivera@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
